<title>UK: NIB sets 5.0 billion escudos seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>NIB sets 5.0 billion escudos seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Citibank Portugal and Citibank International and Banco CISF.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDIC INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    5.0 BLN PTE   SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    16.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LISBOR PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   12 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) **	  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC   7 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **10-100-1(M) 10(M) 50(M)</p>
<p>		ISSUED UNDER NTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
